    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "42B8B60A9AC12980",
      "text": "星塵大作戰進行得很順利呢。\\n剩下２個老大啊……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "42B8B70A9AC12B33",
      "text": "託這個作戰的福，\\n讓我看清楚了很多事，真是幫了我大忙。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "42B8BC0A9AC133B2",
      "text": "……話說回來，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得仙后如何？[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
