      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "3089BD2EAC3FD82C",
      "text": "很可疑",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "3089C02EAC3FDD45",
      "text": "做得很對",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0080_select_03",
      "hash64": "3089BF2EAC3FDB92",
      "text": "不可思議",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0080_select_04",
      "hash64": "3089BA2EAC3FD313",
      "text": "我不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "42B8BD0A9AC13565",
      "text": "……原來如此。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "42B8BA0A9AC1304C",
      "text": "依我來看，\\n我不覺得仙后厭惡或憎恨天星隊。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "42B8BB0A9AC131FF",
      "text": "那傢伙想讓天星隊解散的\\n真正理由究竟是……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0080_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "42B8C00A9AC13A7E",
      "text": "……我差不多該回去監視了。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要進攻基地的話，記得叫我啊。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
